Third-party supplier files — NOT covered by this project's licence.

Files in this directory belong to the brand that makes the part: geometry
downloaded from them, datasheets and catalogues they published, and the FreeCAD
documents we build from those files. A document built from a supplier's model is
derived from their work, so it is theirs too.

They are used here under each brand's own terms, which are recorded in the
`[brand]` table of that brand's `okh.toml`. They are excluded from the
CC BY-SA 4.0 licence that covers the record this project compiles, and from
every other licence named in the repository root LICENSE.

Provenance for each file — brand, part number, source address, checksum and
redistribution terms — is recorded in `vendor-index.csv`.

Files marked `fetch-only` may not be redistributed and are therefore not
committed. Only their manifest row is. Fetch them from the brand before CAD
work.

Removing or replacing a supplier's file does not change the licence of the
record this project compiles. See the repository root LICENSE for the full
overview and TRADEMARKS.md for reserved marks.
